Increases local gravity in a radius of 4 for [4, 5, 6, 7, 8 (TL1-5; PARADOX 300)] turns, dealing [35, 47, 56, 64, 71 (TL1-5; SP 100; PARADOX 300)] physical (gravity) damage as well as decreasing the global speed of all affected targets by [7%, 15%, 20%, 23%, 26% (TL1-5; PARADOX 300)].

The damage done will scale with your Spellpower.
